3. Feature Stability Assessment
Looking at your code, you have many features but no systematic way to assess which ones remain predictive across different market conditions.
What top firms do: They rigorously track feature importance across time windows and market regimes, automatically downweighting unstable features and emphasizing those with persistent predictive power.
4. Competitive Positioning Against Institutional Players
As crypto markets mature, institutional players are rapidly deploying sophisticated quantitative techniques. Without an ensemble approach, you're essentially bringing a knife to a gunfight.
